  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nI found a minor typo in the provided text. It appears in the following sentence:\r\n\r\n\"Due to the long legacy of the existing text the guidelines below are not always applied.\"\r\n\r\nThe correct sentence should be:\r\n\r\n\"Due to the long legacy of the existing text, the guidelines below are not always applied.\"\r\n\r\nThe missing comma after \"existing text\" should be added for correct punctuation.",
